type: software
abstract: "Version 1.7.1 of the D-Algebra package containing experiments for the computation of Centralizers with rational, hyperbolic and elliptic coefficients. It contains the code of the package `dalgebra` together with the code and notebooks used for the experiments on the paper `Effective computation of centralizers of ODOs`."
